WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.580
You see me, don't you? Help me.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.870
Let me rest.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.820
No, I can't do that.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.110
<i>Allow me to explain.</i>

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:19.240
<i>Mamiya Sakura has gotten lost in the Reidou.</i>

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.390
<i>There's at least fifty times 
more of them than usual.</i>

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.770
Please.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.250
Listen to me.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.880
Come on, wait.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>If only Rokudou-kun were here.</i>

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:45.270
<i>Long story short, well, it's complicated.</i>

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.120
Please, let me rest.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.970
You can do it!

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.250
I'm sure you know how.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.030
<i>Huh?</i>

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.680
<i>Me? Save spirits like Rokudou-kun does?</i>

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:37.670
Naggy

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.680
Welcome

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.680
An ATM?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.960
Now, deposit the resting fee.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.840
We can rest for 10,000 yen each.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.060
10,000 yen?

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.530
Wait, hang on...

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.730
Rokudou-kun said it was 
something like 500 yen.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.500
It's too much.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.970
What are you—

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.200
Sneak, sneak...

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.200
<i>A zipper?</i>

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.030
<i>There.</i>

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:06.680
Oops.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.540
A Damashigami.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.120
Damn.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.400
You figured us out.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.710
Now...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.840
If you aren't paying...

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.130
...we'll just have to take you to the afterlife!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.060
Mamiya Sakura, are you okay?

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.100
Rokudou-kun.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.250
That's enough.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.700
Mamiya Sakura-sama, you pass.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:49.750
I've been observing your activities today.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:51.060
What?

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.330
So then...

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.540
This woman's the peeper!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.440
This is who I am.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.590
Damashigami Company President's 
Office Hot Secretary?

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.930
You're one of my dad's people!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:15.310
Mamiya Sakura-sama, I thought 
you were just a human girl.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.590
However, you can see spirits. You're not afraid 
of them, and you aren't deceived by them.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.190
You're very promising.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:22.970
Please, have this.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.950
A ring?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.580
Now, Rinne-sama, put it on her finger.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.190
It's an engagement ring.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.200
You're dating Sakura-sama, are you not?

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.250
The president said so.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:40.590
The reason Rinne's so attached
to the human world is

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.380
because he has a crush on a human girl.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.610
But, Sakura-sama, you'd do fine.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:53.250
You're capable enough to marry Rinne-sama 
and inherit Damashigami Company together.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.390
Clap, clap, clap...

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:08.240
"Invoice: ring, 1 million yen.
 Rokudou Rinne-sama"

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.660
Explain this!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.370
What do you mean, "explain"? 
It's your engagement ring.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:20.250
Now, please, Rinne-sama, 
give this to Sakura-sama.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.170
I can't have it.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:28.070
Rokudou-kun and I are just classmates.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.760
Besides...

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.770
<i>Her memories are slightly off.</i>

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.940
Yeah, I can't have it.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.200
I've found you, Damashigami!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.580
You reek of evil.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.980
You're a Damashigami.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.210
I, Ageha the Shinigami, will punish you!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.030
That girl.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.210
Rinne-sama, are you okay?

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.550
Just classmates, huh?

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:11.170
Damashigami, prepare yourself!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:12.550
Farewell!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.170
A smokescreen!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.750
What's going on?

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:27.190
That Shinigami girl, Ageha, is hunting 
Damashigamis in place of her missing sister.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.150
Missing? What?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:32.470
She found a boyfriend when she 
went to fight a Damashigami.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:35.130
Apparently, she abandoned her 
work to run off with him.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.500
You're not getting away!

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:46.000
A bear?!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.090
That was an escape technique.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.350
For Japan's Future
 Happy Japan

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:54.730
There!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:02.820
Not bad, little girl.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.690
That Shinigami scythe.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.530
That belongs to my missing sister.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.490
Why do you have it?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.120
Oh? What are you talking about?

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:15.830
Answer me!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.140
Or else...

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:21.960
Do you think you can get me with those coins?

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.270
<i>No, she got her.</i>

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.210
<i>Dead-center.</i>

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.720
O-Onee-chan?!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.650
You've got the wrong person.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.580
What are you doing, Onee-chan?

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.550
Nope. Nope.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:40.210
Why are you with the Damashigamis?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.040
Looks like you're having a bit of a fight.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:45.360
Dad.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.710
President?!

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:47.610
President?

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.510
So, Miss, what's your answer?

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.250
Huh?

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.910
You know, about getting married to Rinne 
and inheriting Damashigami Company.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.160
Inherit Damashigami Company?!

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:00.660
What did you say just now?!

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:02.410
Hm?

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:04.670
Who's that man?

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.610
Some old stranger.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.880
That red hair!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.630
Summer greetings!
 I have a boyfriend now!!
 He's an older guy, 
but he's so nice!
 I'm so happy! \(^o^)/

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.560
Onee-chan's boyfriend?!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:18.490
We're pretty steady!

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.210
Stop it, President!

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:24.790
Staaaaaaaare...

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.750
Sorry, Ageha.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.020
It's not like I betrayed you.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.470
It just so happened that 
the man I fell in love with

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:45.120
was the president of Damashigami Company.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:49.080
I became his secretary only because 
I wanted to be close to him.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.550
You're his employee?!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.550
It's a ring.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.530
That's—

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.890
<i>It's that ring.</i>

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.810
Maybe I'll give it to my hot secretary.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:04.350
You.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.170
Support Dad's love.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.650
You bought that ring with my money!

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:11.650
Dad?

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.780
You...

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.090
You were all in on this!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.120
How could you trick me?!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.850
It's a mistake.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.120
But remember...

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:31.630
<i>Her memory is slightly off.</i>

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:38.760
Staaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaare...

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:35.330
You promised! You held my hand so tightly!

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.370
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:44.010
Rinne, you've got <i>two</i> girls?

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.160
That's my boy!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.440
You stay out of this!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:50.650
Farewell!

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:53.650
Stop!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.740
Your father took the engagement 
ring amidst the confusion.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:02.230
He left his 1 million yen invoice 
to you, though, Rinne-sama.

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.920
Mrowwwwr

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.920
Mrowwwwr.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.380
Mamiya Sakura.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.050
This might not be the best time, but...

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:17.270
No matter how much I think about 
it, it happened like this!

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:20.890
I want to make that clear.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.290
Did it?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.840
Well, I don't care either way.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:31.910
<i>I wonder if that Ageha 
girl likes Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.750
Where did they go?

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.930
I'm sure they went to 
the Damashigami Company.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:38.950
Take me there!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.660
If I knew where they were, I would 
have taken my dad down long ago.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:44.830
Huh?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.590
But we were just there.

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:50.060
We were <i>taken</i> there that time, remember?

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.540
We can't get there because we want to.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:58.810
Dad changes the route from the 
Reidou to the company every day.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.050
Damashigami
Company

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:02.580
Boop!

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.500
Damashigami
Company

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:18.900
Wait, it might be a trap!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.050
Shut up!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.120
I knew it was a trap!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:31.120
Mamiya Sakura, go back to the 
living world with Rokumon!

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:32.540
Rokudou-kun!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:36.460
I know this sounds naggy, 
but Ageha and I aren't even friends yet.

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.460
Rokudou-kun.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:42.900
He's so naggy.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.260
Don't say that, Sakura-sama.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.260
Wait, Onee-chan!

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.910
Sorry, Ageha.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.490
I'll find happiness with this man.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:02.830
Wake up, Onee-chan!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.070
He's the Damashigami leader!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:10.190
Onee-chan!

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:15.790
Just a dream.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.660
No, it's not a dream!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.660
Onee-chan's become the Damashigami 
Company president's puppet!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.770
I have to go after them.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:28.050
I can't forgive her. 
Not even if she's my sister.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:31.390
Don't move, Miss.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:36.660
You'll get tangled in the spider's 
web if you keep squirming.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.520
I'll come save you.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.150
Thanks.

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:47.950
You must be a Shinigami, lady.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.110
Yes.

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.040
And you?

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.600
Me?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:55.210
I'm a Shinigami, like you!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.540
I'm an undercover agent 
going after the Damashigami.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.810
An ally!

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:03.190
Will you assist me in my investigation?

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.450
If you will, sign here 
on this agreement form.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.460
I will.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.970
Don't fall for it!

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.890
Rokudou Rinne.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.380
You got me.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.540
Damashigami!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.980
Look at that form carefully.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:25.900
IOU?

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.070
Don't be so quick to sign things.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.610
You were about to become swamped in debt.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:31.980
I'm not thanking you.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.080
Hey.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:37.560
You're the Damashigami 
leader's son, aren't you?

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.540
I can't trust you.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.620
I'm telling you to be careful.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:42.920
This place is full of Damashigami traps.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:44.920
Quit following me.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:59.730
Taiyaki

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.100
Aren't you going home, Sakura-sama?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.270
No, I'm still worried.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.610
Where did Rinne-sama go?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.410
Rinne-sama.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.530
Congratulations!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:17.520
You are the 285,627th person 
to walk this street.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.230
Me?

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:21.110
Let's take a souvenir photo.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.340
Here's your souvenir!

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.570
I can't take it.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.890
Don't say that.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.610
Foiled.

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:54.870
All aboard for Damashigami Company.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.210
To the company?

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:58.430
I'm getting on!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.230
Ticket, please.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:02.040
How much?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.170
30,000 yen, please.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.150
Here.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.640
She just dished out 30,000 yen!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:11.090
The ship is departing!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.940
And it sinks.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:20.600
Ma'am, lifesaver rentals for 50,000 yen.

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.520
I'll take it!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.520
I can't take it anymore!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.150
I'll take it!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:28.820
Hey!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.570
No more wasting money!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:38.040
Seriously, how did you make it all this time?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:39.830
What the heck are you talking about?

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.790
You're being ripped off.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.080
Why do you just hand over money like that?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.500
What are you, a princess?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:16:01.640
Medicine

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:50.520
Ah, your family was deceived by 
Damashigami, and she isn't coming home.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.510
I have just the drug to wake her up!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.930
Megasamyl!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.020
80,000 yen per dose.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.080
That's a bargain!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.160
Sold!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.860
You <i>are</i> a princess.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.480
Thank you.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.750
What was that for?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:06.730
Damn, discovered.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:07.480
Damashigami.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.050
I'm not going to say thanks.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:12.460
Fine.

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:16.490
I guess you don't even care that you're 
being conned out of your money.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.920
I don't care anymore.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.050
I'm going home.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.000
Jeez.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.170
I never even asked him to come with me.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.760
Rinne

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.880
Have this!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.920
I want you to have it.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.100
Come on!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.210
You're such an angel!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.210
Have it!

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.060
I brought this for you!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.680
This is yours!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:44.410
Take it!

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:45.520
I can't accept it.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.760
Mamiya Sakura!

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.160
Take it, please!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:52.330
You're leaving me?

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.900
Come on, have it!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.910
There's so many of them.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:56.690
Come on, come on!

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:57.880
Look at me!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:57.880
Dibs!

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.100
I'm begging you!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:16:59.410
Here.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.920
Pretty please!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.090
Hey, girl.

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:06.620
Yo, yo, yo, yo, yo!

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.840
Sakura-sama.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.290
That's enough.

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.310
Are you safe, Mamiya Sakura?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:28.230
Rokudou-kun.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.250
I finally got it back from my dad.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:32.610
Here.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.740
The engagement ring.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:04.590
The ring!

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:05.230
The ring!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.080
The ring!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.560
Of course you'd know.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.760
Let's go.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.530
Okay.

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:25.250
What do you really think, Sakura-sama?

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.000
Huh?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.600
About Rinne-sama.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:34.000
I know this sounds naggy, but Ageha 
and I aren't even friends yet.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.920
I wonder.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:42.440
Yeah, I'm sure a normal woman 
wouldn't go for a poor Shinigami.

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.050
Being poor is his fatal flaw.

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:48.180
Like, nothing good comes of being poor.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.990
Rokumon-chan.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.230
You're so naggy.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.520
Damn it.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.900
That kid keeps wasting money.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.330
Boiiiing.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.580
<i>She's a girl, too, but she's 
not the same as Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:16.590
I can't accept an engagement ring.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:20.100
Rokudou-kun and I are just classmates.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.130
<i>I guess that's how Mamiya Sakura feels.</i>

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:29.470
<i>And Dad took the ring.</i>

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:32.970
<i>All I have left is a 1 million yen invoice.</i>

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:33.020
Invoice
 Rokudou Rinne-sama
 Engagement Ring
 1,000,000 yen
 Daiya Mondo

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.850
<i>A million yen.</i>

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.270
<i>You'll regret this, Dad.</i>

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.590
A million yen bounty!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.660
A bounty hunter, are we, little girl?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.580
I don't want money.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.350
I punish Damashigamis!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:52.920
Wait—

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.530
Prepare yourself!

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:57.560
Gotcha!

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.250
Water!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.640
See ya!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.470
One.... miiiillion...

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.060
Rokudou Rinne!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.730
Yen!

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:28.700
I thought you left.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:31.190
I told you in the beginning.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:33.370
I despise Damashigami, too.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.610
I was scared.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.880
Thanks.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.770
For coming back to save me.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.590
No need to thank me.

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:55.310
I just—

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.800
Rinne-sama.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:00.070
Staaaaaaaare...

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.340
Mamiya Sakura.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.320
No, this is...

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.640
Sorry, Rokudou-kun.

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:09.600
I shouldn't have come unannounced.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:15.300
Rinne-sama, he had a
1 million yen bounty on him!

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:18.670
You can pay off the ring!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:20.950
There you have it.

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.050
Got it, guys?

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:24.950
Take me home, Rokumon-chan.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.670
Okay, Sakura-sama.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.360
Mrowrr!

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:30.890
Listen to me.

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:48.910
<i>Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.650
<i>She's got the wrong idea again.</i>

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:06.710
I can't sleep!

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.940
<i>Why can't I sleep?</i>

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:30.240
You're so naggy.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:25.230
Next Episode:
  It's Not a Date!

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:03.290
What's wrong, Sakura-chan?

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:05.290
My chest feels kind of heavy.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:06.370
Are you sick?

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:08.320
Or did you overeat?

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:13.400
It's been ever since I saw Rokudou-kun 
being friendly with another girl.

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:14.550
Isn't it weird?

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:15.480
Doesn't that mean?

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:17.220
So you two are dating—

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:19.180
Quit meddling, both of you!

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:21.990
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: "It's Not a Date!"

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:22.810
No!

00:24:23.030 --> 00:24:25.230
I won't allow it!
